<title>FRANCE: Arthuis hopes euro transfer will be about 6.50 Ffr.</title>
<headline>Arthuis hopes euro transfer will be about 6.50 Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>French Finance Minister Jean Arthuis said on Wednesday he hoped that the transition to a euro single currency would be at a rate of around 6.50 francs per euro.</p>
<p>&quot;I hope the the transition will happen at a rate of about 6.50 francs,&quot; Arthuis, speaking at a conference, said of the rate between the franc and the euro.</p>
</text>
